  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fey Touched provides a +1 increase to any mental ability score plus more spells, making this an easy choice for any spellcasting class. Misty Step is a 2nd-level spell, and is among the most tactically-impactful spells in the game. On top of those benefits, you get the daunting task of selecting a 1st-level Divination or Enchantment spell to learn and cast for free once per day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Despite how powerful it is, Fey Touched is not necessarily the best way for your character to get access to these spells. If you primarily want misty step, the Eladrin and the Shadar-Kai both teleportation, and the Githyanki can cast Misty Step. Unless you plan to use both spells frequently and put additional spell slots into casting both of them more than once per day, consider other options."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The clear winner among Fey Touched’s spell options is Silvery Barbs, because of course it is."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For more information about spellcasting feats, including ratings of the various feats, see our "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "Spellcasting Feats Guide",
              "href": "https://rpgbot.net/dnd5/characters/feats/spellcasting-feats/"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
